title: XenServer / XCP-ng: Host CPU
agents: xenserver
catalog: app/citrix
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk

description:
 This check monitors the average physical CPU utilization of a XenServer host
 (RRD data source cpu_avg) with default levels 90/95%. The dom0 load average
 and the number of running vCPUs are shown. Data comes from the special agent
 {agent_xenserver}.

discovery:
 One service {XenServer Host CPU} per host with RRD data.
